package kokkos
package kokkos newton on neigh half
# Test 1g: equilibrium density of the rocksalt crystal with the production model (epoch 301), for comparison with
# the amorphous density of the reference melt-quench (md_meltquench, same model: 30.14 A^3/atom at 300 K).
#   3x3x3 x0 rocksalt -> minimize -> NPT iso 0 bar at T: 20 ps equilibration, then V/atom and density averaged
#   over 20 ps -> density_<cell>_<T>K.txt. The equilibration length equals the averaging window, so the window
#   starts on a multiple of Nfreq (fix ave/time only writes at multiples of Nfreq; see common/in.rdf).
# Run with -var T <K>. dt from common/defaults.sh (passed by submit.sh).
units           metal
atom_style      atomic
boundary        p p p
# model: required, -var model $MODEL (common/defaults.sh picks models/$MODEL_ID[.G|.N].nequip.pt2 per node)
read_data       ../../structures/333/${cell}.data
read_data       ../../structures/333/x0.data
